        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ad93e268-3d6e-4aba-bec0-607cb5451ac7).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, your targets are Athena Savalas, Fabian Mann, Sita Morris and journalist Ruby Red. The board of the Milton-Fitzpatrick bank has been notified by an unnamed individual of fraudulent files of Savalas and Mann&apos;s actions.\r\rWith your two other targets, they are whistleblowers who pose a risk at exposing the files and leaking them to the public. The board dosen&apos;t want that risk. As a result the board will give us a bonus for the files.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
